# Extreme: a message sent, then lines typed just as the agent's answer comes in (2.1 s after), and all taken back as
# it grows: the composer's change and the answer's on one way.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 帮我看一下构建
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1950
type 还有
key shift+enter
type 这个
key shift+enter
wait 150
clear
wait 2500
exit
